00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:10.950
Are you so stoked about this?

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:12.423
- I'm stoked. I love it.

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:16.890
Mike Shannon plays George Jones.

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:18.360
We worked with Ron Browning.

